*Your faction standing with [[Kromzek]] got better.
*Your faction standing with [[Kromrif]] got better.
*Your faction standing with [[King Tormax (Faction)]] got better.
*Your faction standing with [[Claws of Veeshan]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

: Kyenka says "You serve the crown well. Lias.  This is one less beast to ruin our lands. Take these pauldrons which I had fashioned from the lst dragon scales brought to King Tormax's court."

